# A round flange: a bore, a rim, and six bolt holes on a pitch circle.
circle rim r 60 at 0,0
circle bore r 20 at 0,0
construction circle pitch r 42 at 0,0
concentric bore rim
concentric pitch rim
circle bolt r 4 at 42,0
on bolt.center pitch
array bolts of bolt 6 around 0,0
on bolts[2].center pitch
on bolts[3].center pitch
on bolts[4].center pitch
on bolts[5].center pitch
on bolts[6].center pitch
equal bolts[1] bolts[2] bolts[3] bolts[4] bolts[5] bolts[6]
